cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "MDRG: Graph-Riemannian Multi-View Fusion for EEG Imagined Speech Decoding"
abstract: >-
  Subject-specific decoder for the five-command BCIC2020-IV imagined speech
  benchmark, combining a compact temporal-spatial CNN with a 1656-dimensional
  multi-view descriptor, evaluated on the official held-out test split.
